        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 4FBS, 4 Inch Flush Bolt With Square Corners</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Short 4 Inch Flush Bolt (also know as an door edge bolt) is installed into the edge of the door and has a toggle lever that is moved up and down to push the attached rod and bolt into a header or threshold (footer), which locks or unlocks an inactive door. The Solid Brass 4 Inch Flush Bolt with Square Corners is often used on cabinet and furniture doors. Please see our guide on <a href=\"/pages/add-extra-security-to-your-home-with-flush-bolts\">the uses of flush bolts</a>. Packaged complete with flush bolt, matching finish screws, and strike plate.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-4FBS.gif?v=1704354564\" width=\"487\" height=\"316\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 4FBS 4 Inch Flush Bolt Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Also Available:</b>\r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-6-inch-flush-bolts-with-square-corners-deltana-del-6fbs\">6\" Square Corners</a>\r\n -  <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-6-inch-flush-bolts-with-round-corners-deltana-del-6fbr\">6\" Round Corners</a>\r\n -  <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-7-inch-flush-bolt-deltana-7fbr\">7\" Round Corners</a>\r\n - <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-extension-flush-bolts-12-18-and-24-inches-deltana-del-efb\">Extension Flush Bolts in 12\", 18\", 24\"</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana Small Flush Door Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Corner: Square</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Diameter: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Thickness: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/4FBS.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 4FBS Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 4 Inch Flush Bolts with Square Corners, Deltana 4FBS",
                "description": "The Short 4 Inch Flush Bolt (also know as an door edge bolt) is installed into the edge of the door and has a toggle lever that is moved up and down to push the attached rod and bolt into a header or threshold (footer), which locks or unlocks an inactive door. The Solid Brass 4 Inch Flush Bolt with Square Corners is often used on cabinet and furniture doors. Packaged complete with flush bolt, matching finish screws and strike plate. Available in 9 different finishes.  \r\n",
